[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the API design allows direct access to image files through their identifiers (`imageId`) without implementing proper access control mechanisms. If the `imageId` is predictable or not sufficiently protected, unauthorized users could potentially access or manipulate images they are not authorized to view. This lack of robust authentication or authorization checks on the `imageId` parameter could lead to unauthorized exposure of sensitive or private data.

